    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361900/extras/a0f293ac8474f3e6d4c97884a8f39d2f.poster.avif?t=1745418713\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361900/extras/a0f293ac8474f3e6d4c97884a8f39d2f.webm?t=1745418713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361900/extras/a0f293ac8474f3e6d4c97884a8f39d2f.mp4?t=1745418713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br><strong> </strong><br><strong>Explore the Untold Story of the south american Tahuantinsuyo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Quipu Runner: Warmi\u2019s Legacy</i> is a groundbreaking action-adventure game that immerses players in the awe-inspiring world of the Incan Empire. Set in 1471 C.E., you step into the shoes of Warmi, a courageous survivor of a secret society dedicated to safeguarding the empire\u2019s ancient wisdom. Following the death of Emperor Pachacuteq and a devastating betrayal, Warmi embarks on a harrowing quest for survival, vengeance, and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the first game inspired by the Incas, <i>Quipu Runner: Warmi\u2019s Legacy</i> invites players to explore the vibrant landscapes and rich history of South America\u2019s ancient civilizations. With breathtaking visuals, intricate gameplay, and a compelling narrative, this epic adventure delivers an experience that is as unforgettable as it is historically profound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Now and Join Warmi\u2019s Fight for the untold Truth!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361900/extras/f9ede70b9d1e755c72285c8b4b514cb4.poster.avif?t=1745418713\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361900/extras/f9ede70b9d1e755c72285c8b4b514cb4.webm?t=1745418713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361900/extras/f9ede70b9d1e755c72285c8b4b514cb4.mp4?t=1745418713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Mythology Meets Reality</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter legendary figures and mythical creatures inspired by the rich tapestry of local lore, as Warmi\u2019s journey weaves seamlessly between the realms of history and myth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf04 <strong>Authentic Historical Setting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a richly detailed world inspired by the Tahuantinsuyo landscape, from vibrant cities to sacred buildings and treacherous mountain passes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>A Tale of Legacy and Identity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Warmi\u2019s story as she battles inner demons, faces betrayal, and discovers the strength to shape her destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzles and Mysteries</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of the <strong>Quipu</strong>, an ancient information system of knotted strings. Decode its secrets to unveil hidden messages, uncover lost technologies, and unlock pathways to ancient, forgotten knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Combat and Parkour</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fast-paced combat with traditional weapons, and navigate the environment with fluid parkour-inspired movement, climbing, and exploration.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361900/extras/a0f293ac8474f3e6d4c97884a8f39d2f.poster.avif?t=1745418713\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361900/extras/a0f293ac8474f3e6d4c97884a8f39d2f.webm?t=1745418713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361900/extras/a0f293ac8474f3e6d4c97884a8f39d2f.mp4?t=1745418713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br><strong> </strong><br><strong>Explore the Untold Story of the south american Tahuantinsuyo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Quipu Runner: Warmi\u2019s Legacy</i> is a groundbreaking action-adventure game that immerses players in the awe-inspiring world of the Incan Empire. Set in 1471 C.E., you step into the shoes of Warmi, a courageous survivor of a secret society dedicated to safeguarding the empire\u2019s ancient wisdom. Following the death of Emperor Pachacuteq and a devastating betrayal, Warmi embarks on a harrowing quest for survival, vengeance, and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the first game inspired by the Incas, <i>Quipu Runner: Warmi\u2019s Legacy</i> invites players to explore the vibrant landscapes and rich history of South America\u2019s ancient civilizations. With breathtaking visuals, intricate gameplay, and a compelling narrative, this epic adventure delivers an experience that is as unforgettable as it is historically profound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Now and Join Warmi\u2019s Fight for the untold Truth!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361900/extras/f9ede70b9d1e755c72285c8b4b514cb4.poster.avif?t=1745418713\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361900/extras/f9ede70b9d1e755c72285c8b4b514cb4.webm?t=1745418713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361900/extras/f9ede70b9d1e755c72285c8b4b514cb4.mp4?t=1745418713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Mythology Meets Reality</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter legendary figures and mythical creatures inspired by the rich tapestry of local lore, as Warmi\u2019s journey weaves seamlessly between the realms of history and myth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf04 <strong>Authentic Historical Setting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a richly detailed world inspired by the Tahuantinsuyo landscape, from vibrant cities to sacred buildings and treacherous mountain passes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>A Tale of Legacy and Identity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Warmi\u2019s story as she battles inner demons, faces betrayal, and discovers the strength to shape her destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzles and Mysteries</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of the <strong>Quipu</strong>, an ancient information system of knotted strings. Decode its secrets to unveil hidden messages, uncover lost technologies, and unlock pathways to ancient, forgotten knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Combat and Parkour</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fast-paced combat with traditional weapons, and navigate the environment with fluid parkour-inspired movement, climbing, and exploration.</p>",
    "short_description": "Quipu Runner: Warmi\u2019s Legacy is a game set in 1471 C.E., inspired by ancient South American civilizations. Join Warmi, a skilled Quipu Runner, on a journey of vengeance and discovery through the Tahuantinsuyo. Master parkour, combat, and the secrets of the quipu system in this epic adventure!",
